      "message": "I\u0027m sorry I don\u0027t get your point regarding \"stale cache values\" and \"memory barrier\" here.\n\nI don\u0027t see any potential issue without \"lock\" prefix. Although I don\u0027t have number increased by keeping the \"lock\" prefix but it\u0027s obvious there\u0027re more fetching, decoding, waiting for memory bus locked/unlocked(?).\n\nThis is pre-/post-amble of ISR which is executed so much frequently.",
